# Copy to .env and adjust as needed. Any AppSettings field can be
# overridden this way — nested fields use "__" as the delimiter
# (Section FR-15.1). This is the highest-precedence configuration layer
# aside from variables exported directly into the process environment.
#
# Examples:
# AIPERFOPT_MODE__ACTIVE_MODE=developer
# AIPERFOPT_MONITORING__POLLING_INTERVAL_SECONDS=1.0
# AIPERFOPT_CONTENTION__DECISION_THRESHOLD=0.8
# AIPERFOPT_DIAGNOSIS__CROSS_RESOURCE_DOMINANCE_RATIO=0.6
# AIPERFOPT_RETRAINING__REGRESSION_TOLERANCE=0.1
# AIPERFOPT_API__PORT=8000
# AIPERFOPT_STORAGE__DATABASE_PATH=/absolute/path/to/aiperfopt.db
# AIPERFOPT_LOGGING__LEVEL=DEBUG
